+### Compound Format
+
+Set `compound: true` to combine units, largest first (days down to seconds):
+
+```ts
+ms(5400000, { compound: true })              // "1h 30m"
+ms(93784000, { compound: true })             // "1d 2h 3m 4s"
+ms(3605000, { compound: true })              // "1h 5s"
+ms(-5400000, { compound: true })             // "-1h 30m"
+ms(5400000, { compound: true, long: true })  // "2 hours"
+```
+
+Zero parts are skipped, leftover milliseconds are dropped (`999` becomes `"0s"`), and durations over a day keep counting in days (`"40d"`). `compound` only applies to the short format, so it is ignored when `long` is `true`.
+
 ### Input Formats (Units)
 
